---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import { repo } from '../lib/paths';
---
<Layout title="提交时钟 — Still 时刻" page="submit"><section class="submit-page container"><p class="eyebrow" data-i18n="submit.eyebrow">MAKE TIME TOGETHER</p><h1 data-i18n="submit.title" data-i18n-html>好时钟，<br /><span>值得被看见。</span></h1><p class="submit-intro" data-i18n="submit.intro" data-i18n-html>做了一款浏览器时钟，或发现一个值得收藏的开源作品？<br />把它带来，让更多人找到自己喜欢的时间。</p><div class="submit-steps"><div><span>01</span><h2 data-i18n="submit.workTitle">提供作品</h2><p data-i18n="submit.workDescription">名称、运行地址或 HTML 文件，以及一张清晰的预览图。</p></div><div><span>02</span><h2 data-i18n="submit.sourceTitle">说明来源</h2><p data-i18n="submit.sourceDescription">附上作者、源代码地址与明确的使用许可。我们尊重每一位创作者。</p></div><div><span>03</span><h2 data-i18n="submit.publishTitle">一起上线</h2><p data-i18n="submit.publishDescription">在 GitHub 提交后，我们会审核兼容性与许可，再加入画廊。</p></div></div><a href={`${repo}/issues/new?template=clock-submission.yml`} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="button button-primary"><span data-i18n="submit.button">在 GitHub 提交时钟</span><Icon name="external" size={18} /></a><p class="submit-footnote" data-i18n="submit.footnote">提交需要 GitHub 账号。浏览、使用和收藏时钟无需登录。</p></section></Layout>
